# tam-hyprland-window-pop — toggle to pop-out a tile to stay fixed on a
# display basis.
#
#   tam-hyprland-window-pop [width height x y]
#
# Ported from Omarchy 4.0.4 (omarchy-hyprland-window-pop) for plan 18 R4.15i.
